We provide the technique report of bAd score-ranking system named "System Report.pdf" authored by Zhenyu Yang. Besides, we provide the latest file "Game Point.xlxs" standardizing champion points of all the games bAd recognizes, 
and the full-cycle points and ranking result files "Ranking of xxx.pdf" in "yyy area" folders, where xxx and yyy mean the date and the province, respectively.
